          w-3 h-3
          translate-x-0
        "></span></button></div><p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1.5">Music will automatically play and pause with your active Time Tool.</p></div></div>"
`;

exports[`legacy settings render snapshots > 'settings' slot for 'projects' 1`] = `"<div class="p-4"><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Projects is switched off for this district. An admin turns it on under Admin Settings, Rollouts.</p></div>"`;

